<%# Centred auth card, flanked by decorative vector graphics that bleed
    past the left/right viewport edges. Replaces the earlier split-screen
    layout with an auto-cycling, slowly-scaling RASTER screenshot panel:
    continuously scaling a bitmap resamples every pixel every frame, and a
    screenshot full of 1px grid lines and 8px text is close to the worst
    possible subject for that — it shimmers, and no amount of slowing the
    animation down fixes a resampling artifact. Vector doesn't have this
    problem at all: a <rect> or <circle> just re-renders its path at
    whatever transform is asked of it, so motion on the graphics below
    (see .auth-graphic-drift in application.css) is safe by construction,
    not just "slowed down until it's tolerable."

    The graphics are pure decoration: aria-hidden, pointer-events-none, and
    stacked behind the card (z-0 vs the card's z-10). Hidden below lg: —
    at phone widths they would crowd a form that already has to stack the
    whole page, and the "flanking" composition only makes sense with room
    on both sides. Each graphic is negatively offset past the edge of its
    own wrapper, and the page wrapper's overflow-hidden crops it there —
    that combination is what makes them read as a scene continuing past
    the page rather than as two centred stickers. Sized and positioned so
    the visible remainder stays inside the gutter beside the card even at
    the lg breakpoint's narrowest width (1024px): the card never has
    anything sitting under it. %>
<div class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-surface-50 flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-12">
  <div class="hidden lg:block absolute -bottom-8 -left-8 w-72 h-60 z-0 opacity-70 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <%= render "devise/shared/auth_graphic_left" %>
  </div>
  <div class="hidden lg:block absolute -bottom-8 -right-8 w-72 h-60 z-0 opacity-70 pointer-events-none" data-auth-graphic="right" aria-hidden="true">
    <%= render "devise/shared/auth_graphic_right" %>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-md">
    <%# Brand header %>
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 bg-brand-100 rounded-2xl mb-4">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt-lightning text-brand-fg text-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink-900">TeamSync</h1>
      <p class="text-ink-500 text-sm mt-1"><%= local_assigns[:tagline] || "Plan, track, ship together." %></p>
    </div>

    <%# Card body %>
    <div class="bg-surface-0 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-line p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-1"><%= title %></h2>
      <% if local_assigns[:subtitle].present? %>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-500 mb-6"><%= subtitle %></p>
      <% else %>
        <div class="mb-6"></div>
      <% end %>

      <%= yield %>
    </div>

    <%# Footer links %>
    <% if local_assigns[:footer_links].present? %>
      <div class="text-center mt-6 text-sm text-ink-500 space-x-4">
        <%= footer_links %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
